<title>FINLAND: FINNISH Q1 NOMINAL WAGES RISE 2.6 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH Q1 NOMINAL WAGES RISE 2.6 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish nominal wages rose 2.6 percent on average year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Real earnings rose 2.1 percent in Q1, it said.</p>
<p>Wages rose 2.6 percent in the private sector, 2.8 percent in the public sector and 2.9 percent in the municipal sector, it said.</p>
<p>The average monthly salary was 10,800 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
